---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<section id="rubros" class="lumen relative overflow-hidden bg-background px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-28 scroll-mt-24">
  <div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl">
    <p class="eyebrow">para tu comercio</p>
    <div class="mt-6 max-w-2xl">
      <h2 class="font-lumen-display text-3xl leading-[1.05] text-foreground sm:text-4xl">Hecho para vender materiales sin perder el control.</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground sm:text-base">Desde una venta de mostrador hasta una obra completa. OctopusTrack conecta Ventas, Presupuestos, Stock, Acopios y Cuentas Corrientes en un solo lugar.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-5 sm:mt-14 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <article class="reveal-on-scroll lumen-card rubro-card flex flex-col p-6 sm:col-span-2 sm:p-8" style="--reveal-delay: 0ms">
        <h3 class="font-lumen-display text-2xl leading-tight text-foreground">Mostrador y Venta Rápida</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-lg text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground sm:text-base">Encontrá productos, armá presupuestos, generá remitos y facturá sin hacer esperar al cliente.</p>

        <div class="mt-6 rounded-[10px] border border-border bg-background/50 p-3 sm:mt-8 sm:p-4" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-border bg-card px-2.5 py-1.5">
            <Icon name="search" class="h-3 w-3 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground/60" />
            <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-muted-foreground/80">cód. 966 · caño awaduct</span>
            <span class="ml-auto font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-primary">stock 100</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-1.5 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-md border border-border bg-card px-2.5 py-1.5">
            <div class="min-w-0">
              <p class="truncate font-mono text-[11px] text-foreground">CAÑO AWADUCT 110 X 4.00</p>
              <p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-muted-foreground/70">cód. 966 · $ 23.733,43</p>
            </div>
            <span class="shrink-0 rounded-sm bg-primary/15 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-primary">1,00 u.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md border border-primary/25 bg-primary/10 px-2 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-primary"><Icon name="fileText" class="h-3 w-3" />presupuesto</span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md border border-border px-2 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-muted-foreground/70"><Icon name="receipt" class="h-3 w-3" />remito</span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md border border-primary/25 bg-primary/10 px-2 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-primary"><Icon name="checkCircle" class="h-3 w-3" />factura emitida</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="reveal-on-scroll lumen-card rubro-card flex flex-col p-6" style="--reveal-delay: 110ms">
        <h3 class="font-lumen-display text-xl leading-tight text-foreground">Clientes y Cuenta Corriente</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Centralizá compras, pagos, deuda y movimientos de cada cliente desde un mismo lugar.</p>

        <div class="mt-6 rounded-[10px] border border-border bg-background/50 p-3" aria-hidden="true">
          <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-muted-foreground/70">cuenta corriente</p>
          <dl class="mt-2 space-y-1 font-mono text-[11px]">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><dt class="text-muted-foreground/80">Saldo</dt><dd class="text-foreground">$184.320</dd></div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><dt class="text-muted-foreground/80">Último pago</dt><dd class="text-foreground">$80.000</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="reveal-on-scroll lumen-card rubro-card flex flex-col p-6" style="--reveal-delay: 180ms">
        <h3 class="font-lumen-display text-xl leading-tight text-foreground">Obras y Acopios</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Vendé materiales hoy y administrá retiros parciales manteniendo siempre claro cuánto queda disponible.</p>

        <div class="mt-6 rounded-[10px] border border-border bg-background/50 p-3" aria-hidden="true">
          <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-muted-foreground/70">acopio · obra</p>
          <dl class="mt-2 space-y-1 font-mono text-[11px]">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><dt class="text-muted-foreground/80">Acopio</dt><dd class="text-foreground">$1.250.000</dd></div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><dt class="text-muted-foreground/80">Retirado</dt><dd class="text-foreground">$430.000</dd></div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><dt class="text-muted-foreground/80">Disponible</dt><dd class="text-primary">$820.000</dd></div>
          </dl>
          <div class="mt-2.5 h-1 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-border/70">
            <div class="h-full rounded-full bg-primary/70" style="width: 65.6%"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="reveal-on-scroll lumen-card rubro-card flex flex-col p-6 sm:col-span-2" style="--reveal-delay: 250ms">
        <h3 class="font-lumen-display text-xl leading-tight text-foreground">Precios y Catálogos Grandes</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-lg text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Trabajá con miles de artículos, múltiples listas de precios y actualizaciones masivas sin depender de planillas.</p>

        <div class="mt-6 rounded-[10px] border border-border bg-background/50 p-3 sm:p-4" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
            <span class="rounded-md border border-border bg-card px-2 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] text-muted-foreground">Lista Mayorista</span>
            <span class="rounded-md border border-border bg-card px-2 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] text-muted-foreground">Lista Profesional</span>
            <span class="rounded-md border border-primary/25 bg-primary/10 px-2 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] text-primary">Lista Mostrador</span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-0.5 rounded-md border border-border bg-card px-2 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] text-primary">+8,4%</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-2.5 flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
            <span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-muted-foreground/70">listas por categoría y proveedor</span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md bg-primary px-2 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] font-medium text-primary-foreground"><Icon name="refresh" class="h-3 w-3" />Actualizar precios</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal-on-scroll mt-12 border-t border-border pt-8 sm:mt-16 sm:pt-10" style="--reveal-delay: 320ms">
      <p class="text-center font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted-foreground/70">ideal para comercios de materiales</p>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-2xl text-center text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground/85">
        Ferreterías · Casas de Electricidad · Sanitarios · Distribuidoras · Forrajerías y comercios similares.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-4 flex justify-center">
        <a href="/industrias/" class="group inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-primary transition-colors hover:text-primary/80">
          ver soluciones por industria
          <Icon name="arrowRight" class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-1" />
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* Subtle hover: border becomes slightly more visible; lift, depth and emission
     already come from .lumen-card. */
  .rubro-card {
    transition:
      transform var(--dur-short) var(--ease-soft),
      box-shadow var(--dur-short) var(--ease-soft),
      border-color var(--dur-short) var(--ease-soft);
  }

  .rubro-card:hover {
    border-color: oklch(var(--primary) / 0.3);
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .rubro-card {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>